          "git_sha": "14a34966a01fc7b62681d8db1b6f21ee2f3c98cc",
          "line_end": 15,
          "line_start": 13,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "ouijit/ouijit",
          "url": "https://github.com/ouijit/ouijit/blob/b868ef792dc74f398a61e359d4bbe8df25c435e0/README.md#L13-L15"
        },
        {
          "commit": "b868ef792dc74f398a61e359d4bbe8df25c435e0",
          "git_sha": "14a34966a01fc7b62681d8db1b6f21ee2f3c98cc",
          "line_end": 17,
          "line_start": 17,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "ouijit/ouijit",
          "url": "https://github.com/ouijit/ouijit/blob/b868ef792dc74f398a61e359d4bbe8df25c435e0/README.md#L17-L17"
        },
        {
          "commit": "b868ef792dc74f398a61e359d4bbe8df25c435e0",
          "git_sha": "14a34966a01fc7b62681d8db1b6f21ee2f3c98cc",
          "line_end": 115,
          "line_start": 115,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "ouijit/ouijit",
          "url": "https://github.com/ouijit/ouijit/blob/b868ef792dc74f398a61e359d4bbe8df25c435e0/README.md#L115-L115"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_a1b751d8652d6da717094b5a29f8f098a767203b6c004d613c6b377ff3343d26",
        "slc_cb3d116d59c1998edf044a50cfffffa67411cc31e1081621b42a4462baa00a39",
        "slc_e83cfa042dc6029f40aa44a0ddcebfda8aa0e172c28a19f1bce06cddb8ecc309"
      ],
      "text": "The project is free and open source under AGPL-3.0, with no account, sign-in, or telemetry, and distributes self-contained builds for macOS (Apple Silicon/Intel) and Linux x64."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_5bab2cc5a333c8b903f90830f338ddf4120029d06ab19c3b5146b7f43dd22a08",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "components",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "b868ef792dc74f398a61e359d4bbe8df25c435e0",
          "git_sha": "14a34966a01fc7b62681d8db1b6f21ee2f3c98cc",
          "line_end": 25,
          "line_start": 25,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "ouijit/ouijit",
          "url": "https://github.com/ouijit/ouijit/blob/b868ef792dc74f398a61e359d4bbe8df25c435e0/README.md#L25-L25"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_a7a4d2ee06b602887ec7c7cde3e82d771d98b12805bd12e7a21c1c9b06136c51"
      ],
      "text": "Tasks live on a kanban board; moving a card between To Do, In Progress, In Review, and Done fires a matching lifecycle hook, and starting a task creates an isolated git worktree."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_5f894fe31fd20819adc5d4991dd48df00cd55b4ec4294797c35a2963756ceaff",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "components",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "b868ef792dc74f398a61e359d4bbe8df25c435e0",
          "git_sha": "14a34966a01fc7b62681d8db1b6f21ee2f3c98cc",
          "line_end": 29,
          "line_start": 29,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "ouijit/ouijit",
          "url": "https://github.com/ouijit/ouijit/blob/b868ef792dc74f398a61e359d4bbe8df25c435e0/README.md#L29-L29"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_597dc8a22d70950f75f3c1aa09a054f7c2bbef73c86a9882ced7ab0ec04f3013"
      ],
      "text": "Terminals are cards in a stack with attachable panel tabs: a script runner, a web preview, and markdown files with Mermaid diagrams; non-task shells get their own board strip."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_270c260c280bd20f06162d692613176d1a8e56665778f643c12b5e6a57eb9c75",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "interfaces",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "b868ef792dc74f398a61e359d4bbe8df25c435e0",
          "git_sha": "14a34966a01fc7b62681d8db1b6f21ee2f3c98cc",
          "line_end": 37,
          "line_start": 37,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "ouijit/ouijit",
          "url": "https://github.com/ouijit/ouijit/blob/b868ef792dc74f398a61e359d4bbe8df25c435e0/README.md#L37-L37"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_0c5f6453cba131004fec43631357be79f4b401a11af6ec19b0df36af75f30e7f"
      ],
      "text": "Ouijit shadows agent binaries on PATH to inject lifecycle hooks and a CLI reference into each session, letting agents create tasks, advance the board, and open panels without setup."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_7b8457e7f488730e822425c84f102b052d97ab59acf8fe44ee96d9dc63e7d25e",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "components",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "b868ef792dc74f398a61e359d4bbe8df25c435e0",
          "git_sha": "14a34966a01fc7b62681d8db1b6f21ee2f3c98cc",
          "line_end": 47,
          "line_start": 47,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "ouijit/ouijit",
          "url": "https://github.com/ouijit/ouijit/blob/b868ef792dc74f398a61e359d4bbe8df25c435e0/README.md#L47-L47"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_acf3a165e2b951b1a23d4fdecc4f4e407a3f91c4aa6e5c40cabb05c7edec898b"
      ],
      "text": "Each task terminal shows a diff of its worktree against a merge target, uncommitted changes, or a chosen base, with word-level highlighting and per-line notes routed to the agent in that worktree."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_64406e474e733694ef6b6da5a3d40c5f6edd12499e028256183f06f94f8727b6",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "components",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "b868ef792dc74f398a61e359d4bbe8df25c435e0",
          "git_sha": "14a34966a01fc7b62681d8db1b6f21ee2f3c98cc",
          "line_end": 47,
          "line_start": 47,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "ouijit/ouijit",
          "url": "https://github.com/ouijit/ouijit/blob/b868ef792dc74f398a61e359d4bbe8df25c435e0/README.md#L47-L47"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_acf3a165e2b951b1a23d4fdecc4f4e407a3f91c4aa6e5c40cabb05c7edec898b"
      ],
      "text": "An experimental GitHub surface provides a pull request inbox, locally staged review comments, and merging, driven by the `gh` CLI with `gh auth login` as the only setup."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_a898bebb64a0aad82979737d442811239b0cda75bffbb7a81493f1732d499b12",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "tools-permissions",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "b868ef792dc74f398a61e359d4bbe8df25c435e0",
          "git_sha": "14a34966a01fc7b62681d8db1b6f21ee2f3c98cc",
          "line_end": 59,
          "line_start": 59,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "ouijit/ouijit",
          "url": "https://github.com/ouijit/ouijit/blob/b868ef792dc74f398a61e359d4bbe8df25c435e0/README.md#L59-L59"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_cd9df417c5340ee1269558a684fc119c498a1304fa57824f0cd3934fe6b1675d"
      ],
      "text": "Any terminal can run sandboxed: in a Lima VM mounting only the task's worktree, in place under Seatbelt/Landlock via nono (experimental), or under a user-supplied launcher (experimental)."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_a2ffbd6fb77fddc94805bfe8e48e5e01bdb12b837d5cefc5686ed4a93d1120c9",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "memory-state",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "b868ef792dc74f398a61e359d4bbe8df25c435e0",
          "git_sha": "14a34966a01fc7b62681d8db1b6f21ee2f3c98cc",
          "line_end": 63,
          "line_start": 63,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "ouijit/ouijit",
          "url": "https://github.com/ouijit/ouijit/blob/b868ef792dc74f398a61e359d4bbe8df25c435e0/README.md#L63-L63"
        },
        {
          "commit": "b868ef792dc74f398a61e359d4bbe8df25c435e0",
          "git_sha": "14a34966a01fc7b62681d8db1b6f21ee2f3c98cc",
          "line_end": 79,
          "line_start": 79,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "ouijit/ouijit",
          "url": "https://github.com/ouijit/ouijit/blob/b868ef792dc74f398a61e359d4bbe8df25c435e0/README.md#L79-L79"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_6caab8da91a63fc1f3c068e6e91ef5ed1275ed9e27ffd2bd7791cab38afc1b4e",
        "slc_e7bbb86dee8c3ffe93c39ce8ceaba52ca2aa5b278866ecd758f0b7c95f5e7b8c"
      ],
      "text": "Quitting saves the session, and the next launch offers to restore its terminals in their worktrees, panels included; all data is stored locally in SQLite."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_234cd870d6aac9a32aa5fda069a89c61d690432fcd2d258115840bf8f9d0bad7",
